ading":"Cash Flows from Operating Activities","text":"For the three months ended August 31, 2026 and 2025, net cash flows provided by (used in) operating activities were $(21,295) and $635, respectively."}],"wc":[{"heading":null,"text":"As of August 31, 2026, the Company\u2019s current assets were $1,682, comprising $731 of cash and $951 of prepaid expenses, and our liabilities were $50,503, comprising $23,000 of accounts payable, $19,284 owed to Zaza Bladadze, our sole officer and director and $8,219 of deferred revenue."}],"capex":[{"heading":null,"text":"We have no off-balance sheet arrangements that have or are reasonably likely to have a current or future effect on our financial condition, changes in financial condition, revenues or expenses, results of operations, liquidity, capital expenditures or capital resources."}]},"capex_src":null,"src":{"revenue":{"c":"us-gaap:Revenues","l":"Revenues","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"cor":{"c":"us-gaap:CostOfGoodsAndServicesSold","l":"Cost of Goods Sold","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"gp":{"c":"us-gaap:GrossProfit","l":"Gross Profit","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ga":{"c":"us-gaap:GeneralAndAdministrativeExpense","l":"General and Administrative Expenses","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"opex_total":{"c":"us-gaap:OperatingExpenses","l":"Total Expenses","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"pretax":{"c":"us-gaap:IncomeLossFromContinuingOperationsBeforeIncomeTaxesExtraordinaryItemsNoncontrollingInterest","l":"Income (Loss) Before Income Taxes","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"tax":{"c":"us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit","l":"Provision for Income Taxes","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ni":{"c":"us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss","l":"Net loss","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ocf":{"c":"us-gaap:NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities","l":"Net cash provided by (used in) operating activities","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"da":{"c":"us-gaap:DepreciationAndAmortization","l":"Depreciation, Depletion and Amortization, Nonproduction","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"amort":{"c":"us-gaap:Amorti